<STYLE ID="5">"Spring, huh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"I turn 20 this month, huh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">My mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> got married at 21 or 22, apparently."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Am I... gonna stay like this forever? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Natsumi<STYLE ID="5">, will I never be able to live without you taking care of me...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
