Soon you'll be able to move your body, and you'll be able to walk."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... yeah. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Natsumi<STYLE ID="5">, just like you called my consciousness back, my body'll start moving too, right..."</STYLE><PG>
