{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">She doesn't seem able to hold much hope.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Naturally, since just getting her consciousness back is a miracle in itself...</STYLE><PG>
